  "lines": [
    {
      "bottom": -1071.3333740234375,
      "class": "cm-line cm-activeLine cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "The shared strict message-display predicate is applied when projecting cards",
      "top": -1129.8333740234375
    },
    {
      "bottom": -447.3333435058594,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "nonshrinking horizontal metadata in the three existing shared consumers.",
      "top": -486.3333435058594
    },
    {
      "bottom": -427.8333435058594,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "",
      "top": -447.3333435058594
    },
    {
      "bottom": -408.3333435058594,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "## File editor language support",
      "top": -427.8333435058594
    },
    {
      "bottom": -388.8333435058594,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "",
      "top": -408.3333435058594
    },
    {
      "bottom": -330.3333435058594,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "Every accepted explicit file-open request advances the existing reveal revision,",
      "top": -388.8333435058594
    },
    {
      "bottom": -271.8333435058594,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "including a repeated range-free request for the current resource. The main",
      "top": -330.3333435058594
    },
    {
      "bottom": -213.33334350585935,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "workbench consumes that revision to reveal a hidden Dock. Repeated resource",
      "top": -271.8333435058594
    },
    {
      "bottom": -154.83334350585938,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "identity preserves the editor draft and loaded content; line citations also",
      "top": -213.33334350585935
    },
    {
      "bottom": -115.83334350585938,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "retain their existing exact range reveal behavior.",
      "top": -154.83334350585938
    },
    {
      "bottom": -57.33333587646485,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "The file pane uses the existing forced tab mount so hiding the Dock or selecting",
      "top": -115.83333587646484
    },
    {
      "bottom": 1.1666641235351562,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "another tool retains that single draft owner and its navigation guard. Closing",
      "top": -57.33333587646485
    },
    {
      "bottom": 40.166666746139526,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "the file still clears the canonical target after the guard resolves.",
      "top": 1.1666667461395264
    },
    {
      "bottom": 59.66666793823242,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "",
      "top": 40.16666793823242
    },
    {
      "bottom": 118.16666793823242,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "Workspace selection asks this same editor owner before changing the selected",
      "top": 59.66666793823242
    },
    {
      "bottom": 176.6666717529297,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "source, directory, intent, tools or accepting durable creation/dispatch. File",
      "top": 118.16667175292967
    },
    {
      "bottom": 235.1666717529297,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "closure and the admitted workspace epoch commit synchronously through the file",
      "top": 176.6666717529297
    },
    {
      "bottom": 293.6666717529297,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "owner's guarded boundary. Cancel, an explicit current-source no-op or a newer",
      "top": 235.1666717529297
    },
    {
      "bottom": 352.16668701171875,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "user/committed-fact selection keeps both original file and workspace facts.",
      "top": 293.66668701171875
    },
    {
      "bottom": 410.6666870117187,
      "class": "cm-line cm-oc-reveal-line",
      "text": "Internal hydration/directory primitives consume the explicit epoch; they do not",
      "top": 352.16668701171875
    },
    {
      "bottom": 469.1666870117187,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "start another selection. Committed handoff/removal/recovery facts converge their",
      "top": 410.6666870117187
    },
    {
      "bottom": 527.6666870117188,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "source while retaining the independently scoped file owner and tools.",
      "top": 469.1666870117187
    },
    {
      "bottom": 547.1666870117188,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "",
      "top": 527.6666870117188
    },
    {
      "bottom": 605.6666870117188,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "Concurrent global Composer attachments share the existing single allocation",
      "top": 547.1666870117188
    },
    {
      "bottom": 664.1666870117188,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "owner across admission, anonymous Project creation and complete activation.",
      "top": 605.6666870117188
    },
    {
      "bottom": 722.6666870117188,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "Inputs capture their source epoch and begin transient byte capture immediately.",
      "top": 664.1666870117188
    },
    {
      "bottom": 781.1666870117188,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "The resolver synchronously returns one readonly operation whose Promise yields",
      "top": 722.6666870117188
    },
    {
      "bottom": 820.1666870117188,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "the exact directory/accepted epoch receipt. It explicitly accepts either",
      "top": 781.1666870117188
    },
    {
      "bottom": 859.1666870117188,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "attachment admission or an already admitted epoch. Its",
      "top": 820.1666870117188
    },
    {
      "bottom": 898.1666870117188,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "pointer, current admission sequence and workspace epoch must still agree;",
      "top": 859.1666870117188
    },
    {
      "bottom": 956.6666870117188,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "same-lineage inputs join before a half-activated directory can return early.",
      "top": 898.1666870117188
    },
    {
      "bottom": 1015.1666870117188,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "Fulfilled operations remain current for their accepted epoch after the allocation",
      "top": 956.6666870117188
    },
    {
      "bottom": 1054.1666870117188,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "pointer is released. File and folder inputs register their identity before",
      "top": 1015.1666870117188
    },
    {
      "bottom": 1112.666748046875,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "awaiting; the Composer derives indexing count and Send availability from that",
      "top": 1054.166748046875
    },
    {
      "bottom": 1171.166748046875,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "single live collection. Completion removes only its own token. Receipt and",
      "top": 1112.666748046875
    },
    {
      "bottom": 1210.166748046875,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "operation validation keep late input bound to the Project that accepted it.",
      "top": 1171.166748046875
    },
    {
      "bottom": 1268.666748046875,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "Current failures retain their own error feedback even when allocation rejects;",
      "top": 1210.166748046875
    },
    {
      "bottom": 1307.666748046875,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "actual workspace navigation expires old input effects.",
      "top": 1268.666748046875
    },
    {
      "bottom": 1327.166748046875,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "",
      "top": 1307.666748046875
    },
    {
      "bottom": 1366.166748046875,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "The registered file owner exposes its existing dirty memo for browser exit.",
      "top": 1327.166748046875
    },
    {
      "bottom": 1405.166748046875,
      "class": "cm-line",
      "text": "Only dirty pages register cancellable beforeunload confirmation. Actual page",
      "top": 1366.166748046875
    }
  ],
